## SQ-CWG-01 | Creative Worldgen mixins apply once, More Mooblooms and Baby Mobs nested once
@group A
@commands Boot 2: `grep -E "creativeworldgen.mixins.json\|creativeengineering.mixins.json" logs/latest.log`; `grep -c "from creativeworldgen.mixins.json" logs/debug.log`; mod list
@pass No mixin apply error; the 71 common mixins apply (74 in the jar's json, 2026-11-20) (minus gated ones whose mod is absent: AE2, Quark, MCA, LC, Cloud Storage, Forgiving Void, Bushier Flowers); no worldgen mixin from Creative Common (double apply); one `moremooblooms` and one `babymobs`, nested
@fails Gate id wrong in `WorldgenMixinPlugin`, a moved mixin still in Creative Common's json, or the old standalone jar left in `mods/`
@from batches/r1103/sA_2.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
# r1120fix (2026-11-20): patcherMod is Creative Common since 2026-11-04, its json is creativecommon.mixins.json (not
# creativeengineering.mixins.json); creativeworldgen-1.0.0.jar's json lists 71 common + 3 more mixins (74, read 2026-11-20)
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidMixinException|MixinApplyError).*(creativeworldgen|creativecommon|creativeengineering)
bootreject DuplicateModsFound|Found duplicate mods
shell grep -E "creativeworldgen.mixins.json|creativecommon.mixins.json" logs/latest.log | head -20
shell echo "mixing lines from creativeworldgen.mixins.json: $(grep -c 'from creativeworldgen.mixins.json' logs/debug.log || true)"
shell echo "worldgen mixins still applied from Creative Common's json (should be none of the moved ones):"; grep -oE "Mixing [A-Za-z_.]+ from creativecommon.mixins.json" logs/debug.log | grep -iE "worldgen|structure|locate|leaf|raid|named|forgiving|mobcap|spawn" | sort -u | head -20 || true
shell grep -oiE "(moreMooblooms|babyMobs)-[0-9.]+[^ ]*\.jar" logs/debug.log | sort | uniq -c
shell ! ls mods | grep -iE "^(moreMooblooms|babyMobs)"
look mixing count = the jar's 74 (71 common) minus the gated ones whose mod is absent (AE2, Quark, MCA, LC, Cloud Storage, Forgiving Void, Bushier Flowers: those mods are installed, so expect about 71 to 74); no moved worldgen mixin from creativecommon.mixins.json; each of moreMooblooms / babyMobs found once, from jarjar of creativeworldgen

